1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,590
(Sheldon:)it's actually
extremely plausible.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:06,060
(Leonard:)And your poll numbers
just keep dropping.

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,360
(Priya:)I want to catch up
with all of you,

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,100
(Priya:)but first I really
must visit the loo.

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,270
I'm going, too; I'll
show you where it is.

6
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,530
All right, this goes
without saying,

7
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,240
(Raj:)but I'm just going
to say it anyway.

8
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,510
(Raj:)Hands off my sister.

9
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:22,340
Why would I touch her? She's
covered with airplane germs.

10
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,980
(Raj:)I'm so not talking to you.
I'm talking to him.

11
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:29,670
(Howard:)Hey. I've got a girlfriend now.
Oh, please.

12
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:30,780
(Raj:)My sister's much hotter

13
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,750
(Raj:)than your girlfriend,
and you know it.

14
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,490
(Howard:)Let's just agree
they're both hot.

15
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:37,860
But dude, that's my sister
you're talking about!

16
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,630
(Howard:)Okay, forget who's hotter.

17
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:42,660
(Howard:)The first time Priya came to
L.A., Leonard and I made a pact

18
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,370
(Howard:)out of respect to our
friendship and to you

19
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:47,470
(Howard:)that neither of us
would hit on her.

20
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,100
Did you pinky-swear?

21
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:53,570
(Howard:)Yes.

22
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,310
(Raj:)Okay, then.

23
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:59,450
(Sheldon:)Cobbler. I'm still laughing.

24
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:02,820
(Priya:)It's really nice
to see you again, Leonard.

25
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:04,920
(Leonard:)Yeah. It's good
to see you, too.

26
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,920
(Leonard:)Here you go.

27
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,070
(Priya:)Thanks.

28
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:11,960
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

29
00:01:14,230 --> 00:01:16,130
(Howard:)Okay.

